                        ],
                        "form": "more antigovernment"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "489ec154-bbab-45a2-917b-37d812b9f7ea",
                        "entry_id": "dfa61227-0bd3-3937-bb74-cc97fa0b8fa5",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most antigovernment"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "764c9d51-5ace-3418-b2ef-dbc8d3fa1dbb",
                        "entry_id": "dfa61227-0bd3-3937-bb74-cc97fa0b8fa5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Opposed to a government currently in power."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f03aaa4-22e5-4d4c-a26b-ec32c444513f",
                                "sense_id": "764c9d51-5ace-3418-b2ef-dbc8d3fa1dbb",
                                "text": "Antigovernment protesters marched in the capital."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "affe23dd-5d41-48f6-b69a-e10c9f09bd9c",
                                "sense_id": "764c9d51-5ace-3418-b2ef-dbc8d3fa1dbb",
                                "text": "And finally, the transnational discourses of antiapartheidism and divestiture had led the U.K. television industry to ban sales of current programs to South Africa, again shaping the ways Bop-TV could enact its particular form of antigovernment, antiapartheid cultural politics."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be8a6487-bd05-3e44-a535-833a313f9239",
                        "entry_id": "dfa61227-0bd3-3937-bb74-cc97fa0b8fa5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Opposed to government in general."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d9d851a-3417-41d4-aef3-ea5d43f1e2b5",
                                "sense_id": "be8a6487-bd05-3e44-a535-833a313f9239",
                                "text": "They have an antigovernment philosophy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "faefc4a4-b0c3-4e53-adfc-ef41c85ac786",
                                "sense_id": "be8a6487-bd05-3e44-a535-833a313f9239",
                                "text": "This diverse set of extremists reflects an increasingly complex threat landscape, including racially or ethnically motivated threats and antigovernment or antiauthority threats."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4642f62-c498-4e9b-bda8-d8629dab6c13",
                                "sense_id": "be8a6487-bd05-3e44-a535-833a313f9239",
                                "text": "Domestic extremists are motivated by a range of ideologies which “reflects an increasingly complex threat landscape, including racially or ethnically motivated threats and antigovernment or antiauthority threats,” the report says."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4380471-43d7-4091-a580-bdb143a47d13",
                                "sense_id": "be8a6487-bd05-3e44-a535-833a313f9239",
                                "text": "It is tempting to see these vacancies through the feature-not-a-bug lens of the Republican Party’s antigovernment politics. If a party doesn’t care about governing, why would it care that the government isn’t functioning?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
